ds_before_deadline():\n    async def scenario():\n        q = Queue(maxsize=1)\n        q.put_nowait(\"first\")\n        future = q.put(\"second\", timeout=10.0)\n        assert not future.done()\n        assert await q.get() == \"first\"\n        # Resolves with None well before the 10s deadline.\n        assert await future is None\n        assert q.get_nowait() == \"second\"\n        assert q.empty()\n\n    asyncio.run(scenario())\n```",
